          "Title": "1.01.010 - Adoption.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"runin\">\n               From and after June 20, 1967, the Clark County Code, prepared by Book Publishing Company,\n               codifiers, and approved and accepted, shall be the official code of all the ordinances\n               of a general and permanent character of the county of Clark, state of Nevada.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. 268 § 1, 1967)\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
